WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
VectorMapNet is evaluated on nuScenes and Argoverse2.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:09.692
Following HDMapNet, predicted polylines are
compared to ground truth for crosswalks,

00:00:09.772 --> 00:00:12.188
lane dividers, and road boundaries.

00:00:12.268 --> 00:00:18.465
It reports Chamfer-distance AP and a new
Fréchet-distance AP that respects vertex order,

00:00:18.545 --> 00:00:19.820
plus 3D evaluation.
